  "details": "1. Create an Excellent avatar in Unity Editor\n\n2. Add N particle systems (can be disabled), set its max particles to 0\n\n3. Build & Test Your Avatar, check the local SDK test avatar performance rating in-app (Excellent)\n\n4. Build & Publish Your Avatar Online, and check the performance ranking of the uploaded avatar, it'll be Good or worse as the particle systems are counted on the server\n\nAffected avatar: [Robot （0 max particles）](https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_e785d1e7-6121-4e73-99bd-4bae65e24636) (`avtr_e785d1e7-6121-4e73-99bd-4bae65e24636`) by WubTheCaptain - this has N=1\n\nExpected result: Overall Performance Estimate: Good (or worse) in both scenarios for having > 0 particle systems.\n\nActual result: Overall Performance Estimate: Excellent in local SDK test avatar (0 particle systems, 0 max particles), Good performance ranking once uploaded to VRChat.",
